  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v1.13.3 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n* fix(nextplaid): restore 1.13 component template loading by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16339\n* fix: enforce custom component policy in background workflows by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16383\n* fix(auth): invalidate native sessions after password changes by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16446\n* fix(deps): easy dependency upgrades for 1.13.3 by @Adam-Aghili in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16382\n* fix(playground): accept flow uploads in the shareable playground by @Cristhianzl in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16399\n* fix: read the Assistant's bundled component sources under S3 storage by @david-streamlio in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16365\n* fix: align backend Docker versions with release wheels by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16453\n### Others\n* fix(deps): patch release 1.13.3 security dependencies by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16449\n\n## New Contributors\n* @david-streamlio made their first contribution in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/16365\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/compare/v1.13.2...v1.13.3",
